    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confronted with a fragmented and mysterious family story, a curious young woman travels through time, cares for her dying grandmother, relives fading memories, and makes difficult choices between comforting lies and unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can she uncover what was left unspoken, and discover how her grandmother\u2019s past intertwines with her mother\u2019s life and her own identity?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a curious young woman determined to uncover her family's hidden past. During a visit to her grandmother, she begins piecing together long-forgotten stories. But she soon realizes that simply listening won\u2019t break the cycle. It\u2019s time to intervene\u2014to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transcend time, navigate layered narratives, solve intricate puzzles, and move seamlessly between generations. Your task: unlock the difficult truths buried in her ancestry\u2014and come to terms with what they mean for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear storytelling:</strong><br>Your choices shape which memories surface, which paths open, and which remain hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-spanning narrative:</strong><br>Travel across different periods of family history to understand the present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple perspectives &amp; fragmented memories:</strong><br>Explore how stories shift, overlap, and contradict across generations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-driven gameplay:</strong><br>Interact with characters, objects and memories to uncover emotional and narrative depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Puzzles:</strong><br>Solve challenges that reflect psychological barriers, memory gaps, and emotional truths</p></li></ul><p c